      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. 怎么做到的？\n    比如说创建了子进程之后，子进程的这是三个东西是哪里来的",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. 怎么做到的？\n    比如说创建了子进程之后，子进程的这是三个东西是哪里来的",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dj0qc42TrI2BvoWLx0REs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 95.58004760742188,
      "y": -951.5,
      "width": 796.8399658203125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1167483168,
      "version": 251,
      "versionNonce": 1321729248,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769841465158,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "操作系统在启动父进程时，会自动为它打开标准输入 (0)、标准输出 (1)、标准错误 (2) 这\n三个文件描述符并默认指向终端，而子进程通过 fork 会完整复制父进程的这三个文件描述\n符及其指向。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "操作系统在启动父进程时，会自动为它打开标准输入 (0)、标准输出 (1)、标准错误 (2) 这三个文件描述符并默认指向终端，而子进程通过 fork 会完整复制父进程的这三个文件描述符及其指向。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "E6nCbsM9QZVjWNHycm02L",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 909.3333435058594,
      "y": -989.5000915527344,
      "width": 40,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1314111712,
      "version": 604,
      "versionNonce": 628999456,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769841473641,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "总结",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "总结",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uuJYoEw-EjHFSGjA8SCc9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 907.546630859375,
      "y": -952.5,
      "width": 662.239990234375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1114455328,
      "version": 384,
      "versionNonce": 523972832,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769841472135,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "父进程的标准 IO 流是操作系统启动时自动创建并打开的，默认绑定终端。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "父进程的标准 IO 流是操作系统启动时自动创建并打开的，默认绑定终端。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Mr9SlGH1ddkb7zxaLykgt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 908.6033020019531,
      "y": -916.8333129882812,
      "width": 729.4599609375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1407755488,
      "version": 298,
      "versionNonce": 712035552,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769841475492,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "子进程的标准 IO 流是从父进程复制继承而来，与父进程指向相同的设备 / 文件。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "子进程的标准 IO 流是从父进程复制继承而来，与父进程指向相同的设备 / 文件。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
