      "updated": 1769846765779,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "大家可以思考一下菜鸟驿站的使用\n是不是就跟我们的缓冲区类似呢？",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "大家可以思考一下菜鸟驿站的使用\n是不是就跟我们的缓冲区类似呢？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nDCFysUpkF9BEX-wfyaHq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 98,
      "y": 2698.3333740234375,
      "width": 681.0799560546875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1202848992,
      "version": 150,
      "versionNonce": 1639146720,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769846821951,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "缓冲区的核心作用：提高IO应答效率，解决的是使用缓冲区的\"人\"的效率问题",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "缓冲区的核心作用：提高IO应答效率，解决的是使用缓冲区的\"人\"的效率问题",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
