      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769847040886,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "就像你寄快递：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "就像你寄快递：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "drhuUpI75suhUyXRlrI0-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 2680,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 559464736,
      "version": 150,
      "versionNonce": 605305120,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769847043163,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "语言层缓冲区：你先把小件物品攒成一箱再叫快递员上门（减少叫快递的次数，也就是减少\n系统调用）。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "语言层缓冲区：你先把小件物品攒成一箱再叫快递员上门（减少叫快递的次数，也就是减少系统调用）。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "U1ObuN0MV-H7KJdGxXC_a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 861.3333740234375,
      "y": 2744,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1315397856,
      "version": 153,
      "versionNonce": 1444958432,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769847045629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "内核缓冲区：快递员把你的箱子和别人的包裹凑成一车再拉去分拣中心（减少跑运输的次\n数，也就是减少硬件 IO）。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "内核缓冲区：快递员把你的箱子和别人的包裹凑成一车再拉去分拣中心（减少跑运输的次数，也就是减少硬件 IO）。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
